    "text": "Signal is the sample counterpart of $E[\\tilde{r}_{it} \\tilde{r}_{mt}^2]/( SD[\\tilde{r}_{it} ] SD[\\tilde{r}_{mt}]^2$ where $\\tilde{r}_{it}$ is the de-meaned stock excess return and $\\tilde{r}_{mt}$ is the de-meaned market excess return.  Signal is computed using the past 60 months of monthly data, and using the NYSE/AMEX CRSP VW index for the market (msic).  See code for details.",
